OL,3,GNEWSAWriter hopes Oasis film can help
OL,4,Aend family feuds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe creator and writer of a film
OL,7,Fdocumenting last year's Oasis reunion
OL,8,Ftour has said he hoped it would
OL,9,Fencourage others to resolve family
OL,10,Ffeuds like the Gallagher brothers.
OL,12,FSteven Knight said Oasis: Don't Look
OL,13,FBack In Anger - which charts their
OL,14,Femotional reconciliation after 15 years
OL,15,F- was "incredibly emotional" and had
OL,16,Fresonated with many people.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
