OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWriter hopes Oasis film can help
OL,4,Aend family feuds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Peaky Blinders writer said the
OL,7,Freaction to the candid film - which
OL,8,Fshows "real emotions from real people"
OL,9,F- had been "extraordinary", adding:
OL,10,F"When you write fiction you aspire to
OL,11,Fhaving these kind of reactions."
OL,13,FHe said if it inspired people to get in
OL,14,Ftouch with family members they have not
OL,15,Fspoken to for years "then I'm all for
OL,16,Fit - it's great".
